- Online payments (Stripe Checkout) are implemented: order -> Checkout redirect,
  webhook (routes/payments.js) marks paid + moves stock + writes the financial
  ledger, cancel of a paid order auto-refunds and reverses stock, unpaid orders
  auto-cancel after 24h. To go live:
    1. fly secrets set STRIPE_SECRET_KEY / STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET / PUBLIC_BASE_URL
       (see the comment block in fly.toml)
    2. Add the webhook endpoint in the Stripe dashboard:
       https://<PUBLIC_BASE_URL>/api/payments/webhook
       events: checkout.session.completed, checkout.session.expired
    3. Enable Checkout receipt emails in Stripe dashboard settings.
    4. Run one real low-value order + refund end to end.

- Still open: confirm sales-tax handling with the 501(c)(3) treasurer (add Stripe
  Tax if needed); order-status email notifications; partial refunds.
